  "title": "Southern Macaroni and Cheese",
  "description": "Elbow macaroni is baked with cottage cheese, sour cream, eggs and sharp Cheddar cheese for a rich and flavorful version of this favorite side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda Page"
  ],
